Throughout the Lucky Capsule Limited Event players have a chance to obtain one or more '''Lucky Tickets''' each time they complete one of the Limited Event's Special Stages.

In addition, using a Rare Cat Ticket or spending [[Cat Food]] on an 11 draw during the Limited Event will also award a free Lucky Ticket for each roll. These Lucky Tickets can then be used at any time during the Limited Event to roll the Lucky Capsule. You can also watch an AD to roll 1 Lucky Capsule daily, without spending any tickets.

After rolling the Lucky Capsule, the player will receive '''one item''' from the selection shown below which includes [[Battle Items]], XP and [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]], tiny versions of the Normal Cats called '''[[:Category:Li'l Cats|Li'l Cats]]'''.

